# Global repository -> environment assignments: <repo root><TAB><environment>
# Managed by 'devbox assign' / 'devbox unassign'. Git worktrees inherit their
# primary checkout automatically and must NOT be listed here.
#
# This file ships EMPTY on purpose. Assignments are absolute host paths, so they
# are machine state, not configuration. bootstrap/host.sh installs this template
# only when ~/.config/devbox-router/repos.tsv does not exist yet; it never
# overwrites live assignments.
#
# Most repositories need no entry at all: inference.tsv resolves them from the
# files at the repository root. Add an explicit assignment with
#     devbox assign <environment> <repo>
# only when inference is wrong or ambiguous.
